  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "nightside_depths_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The air here is different. Heavier. Warmer than the caverns above, despite the ice on every surface.",
          "The umbracite deposits are massive — entire walls of dark crystal that pulse with a faint inner light. You've never seen concentrations like this.",
          "Something guards this place. You can feel it watching."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "refined_umbrasite_pickup",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "refined_umbrasite" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "found_refined_umbrasite" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "This isn't like the rough umbracite you've found before. This crystal is perfectly formed — geometric facets that catch even the faintest light and split it into impossible colors.",
          "It's warm in your hands. Almost alive. You understand now why MERIDIAN-7 wants this so badly.",
          "The Array's interest in umbracite isn't just commercial. There's something deeper at work here.",
          "Bring this to MERIDIAN-7 at the Array Hub in Meridian City — but Councillor Asha Denn might want to know about it too."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "depths_umbracite_chest",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileX": 11, "tileY": 14 },
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "umbrasite_escalation_active" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "resonant_core_collected" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "spawnItem", "itemType": "resonant_umbracite_core", "x": 11, "y": 13 },
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "resonant_core_collected" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The sealed chest cracks open, releasing a wave of deep subsonic vibration that you feel in your bones more than hear.",
          "Inside, nestled in crystalline formations, sits a massive umbracite core. Its resonance pattern is unlike anything you've encountered — rhythmic, almost purposeful.",
          "This is what MERIDIAN-7 wants. The question is whether giving it to the Array is wise."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "elder_first_meeting",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": { "npcType": "unbounded_elder" },
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "met_unbounded_elder" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "met_unbounded_elder" },
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "elder_merge_path_revealed" },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 60 },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The figure barely moves as you approach. Ancient eyes open — adapted to near-total darkness, pupils wide as coins.",
          "A voice like slow water over crystal: 'I wondered when one of the Ring's wanderers would find their way here.'"
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "depths_warmth_anomaly",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "depths_warmth_noted" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "depths_warmth_noted", "scope": "player" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "Your suit's temperature display doesn't make sense. You're deeper than the caverns above — ten, maybe fifteen meters further from the surface. The cold should be worse.",
          "Instead: warmer. Something from far below is channeling heat upward through the umbracite veins. They're not just mineral deposits. They're conduits. Part of a living system.",
          "The survey teams mapped this area as geological dead space. The survey teams didn't go deep enough."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "depths_crystal_guardian_warning",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "depths_guardian_warned" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "depths_guardian_warned" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "A deep vibration shakes the floor. Somewhere in the darkness ahead, something massive shifts.",
          "The umbracite veins in the walls pulse brighter for a moment, as if responding to the movement."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "depths_living_crystal_found",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "living_crystal_shard" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The fragment separated cleanly from the wall when you touched it — as if offered. It's warm. Not room-temperature warm. Body-temperature warm, as if it was pressed against living tissue a moment ago.",
          "The resonance matches nothing in the Array's mineral catalog. It pulses at exactly the rhythm of the walls — 0.4 seconds, regular as a heartbeat.",
          "The deeper you go, the stronger it gets. The Unbounded have a name for crystals like this. You've heard Sable use it: 'planet-blood.' She wasn't being poetic."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "chest_loot_nightside_depths",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileName": "chest_closed" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "rollLootTable", "lootTable": "frost_biome_uncommon" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
